Assets and dependencies
-----------------------

This repository does not contain SpliceAI model weights, reference genomes,
GENCODE/MANE datasets, a deployment container, or the SpliceAI package itself.
Model weights must be obtained separately and remain subject to the terms
accompanying the copy obtained by the user. Illumina's current repository
describes the model terms as CC BY-NC 4.0.

Third-party Python and system dependencies retain their own licenses.

Broad Lookup validation
-----------------------

The Broad Institute SpliceAI Lookup service and its MIT-licensed server code
are used only as an external comparator. Raw API response caches are not
distributed because the service-code license does not expressly license API
output data. Query manifests and comparison summaries identify their source;
no project copyright or GPL license is asserted over third-party model scores.

